{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかまりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やはー買い物したいなー\n変な服の欲しいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とぶつぶつ思いながら\n改札でピッしたら\n残高が46円だった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わお"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「46」に反応してしまうのは\n私だけじゃないはず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ前の私服"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おでこ全開だぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"PANAMABOYのボトムかわいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあたたかいコメント\nありがとうございます; ;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣きそうになる、嬉しいなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"札幌には全国握手会来ますか??"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会大阪では\nないんですか～？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道行きたいよ><\nミニ握で行ったもん‼\n全握は今の予定だと...\n名古屋、幕張メッセの2つです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪...なんでないんやろ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか的には秋って\n言ったら何の秋？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おしゃれの秋‼\nなんだかんだ一番遊べる季節。\n冬もそうだけど、\n重ね着を楽しめるもんね♪\n過ごしやすいのは秋かもね‼\nよしゃ秋服買いに行くぞ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(๑•́ ₃ •̀๑)←どう思う？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぷぅってしてる^^笑\n真洋がこんなの描いてそう笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪の個別会いに\n行っていいかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいっっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ‼てゆうか握手しましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケータイの色は何色ですか??"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おれは、HTC J レッドだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しゃきーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9685580/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若様。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}